        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: گزارش",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "گزارش (gozâresh) — \"a report\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "گزارش (gozâresh) او درباره مدرسه های روستا بود. Gozâresh-e u darbâre-ye madrese-hâ-ye rustâ bud. Her report was about the village schools."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural gozâresh-hâ. Built on gozâr-, the stem of gozârdan \"to set out, to render\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "gozâresh is a native Persian noun: the stem gozâr- \"to set out, to render\" with the noun suffix -esh. EtymDB lists no entry."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling, explaining and describing at B1."
